IMPORT strings.
SENTENCE left.
INPUT(left).
SENTENCE right.
INPUT(right).
SENTENCE longer.
IF (left.LENGTH() > right.LENGTH()) { longer=left. }
ELSE { longer=right. }
SENTENCE reversed=longer.REVERSE().
SENTENCE answer.
IF (left.LENGTH()>right.LENGTH()) { answer=left+reversed+'a'. }
ELSE { answer=right+reversed+'a'. }
DISPLAYNL(answer).

